flowchart TD
    A[Real Kopargaon] --> B[Urban Data Collection]
    B --> C[Open GIS + Municipal + Field + Citizen + Project Updates]
    C --> D[Data Validation & Normalization]
    D --> E[Provenance + Confidence + Data Gap Flags]
    E --> F[Spatial Data Store / Master Dataset]
    F --> G[GIS-Enabled Evolving Urban Digital Twin]

    G --> H[AS-IS City Model]
    H --> H1[Infrastructure + Land Use + Roads + Buildings]
    H --> H2[Hospitals + Colleges + Public Facilities]
    H --> H3[Water + Power + Railway + Existing Projects]
    H --> H4[Citizen Issue Patterns]

    H --> I[Identify Development / Resilience Need]
    I --> J[Urban Planning Workspace]

    J --> K{WHAT-IF Scenario}
    K --> K1[Road / Drain / Water / Facility / Land-Use Scenario]
    K --> K2[Godavari Flood Scenario]

    K1 --> L1[GIS Spatial Analysis]
    L1 --> M1[Building Impact + Utility Conflicts + Land-Use Impact]
    M1 --> N[Structured GIS Evidence]

    K2 --> L2[Godavari + Copernicus DEM + Hypothetical River Rise]
    L2 --> M2[Terrain-Connected Inundation Screening]
    M2 --> M3[Buildings + Roads + Facilities + Power + Rail Exposure]
    M3 --> M4[Accessibility + Response + Recovery Priorities]
    M4 --> N

    N --> O[Scenario A / B Comparison]
    O --> P[Metrics + Evidence + Confidence + Limitations]
    P --> Q[AI Planning Assistant]
    Q --> Q1[Explain Risks + Trade-Offs + Show Evidence]
    Q1 --> R[Engineer Review]
    R --> S[Town Planner Review]
    S --> T{Authorized Human Decision}

    T -->|Revise| J
    T -->|Approve| U[Approved Project]
    U --> V[Project Tracking]
    V --> V1[Budget + Timeline + Milestones + Progress]
    V1 --> W[Analytics Dashboard]
    W --> X[Public Transparency]
    X --> Y[Citizen Feedback]
    Y --> G

    V --> Z[AS-BUILT Update]
    Z --> G
